<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Icestorm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Frost Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 34)
Mana: 38
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast icestorm &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast icestorm</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster crosses their arms over their head and screams 'Maelestra 
fresi!', and a storm of ice batters the target. Only the target is hurt. 
The better your magic and your frost sphere, the harder it hits. Like all 
cold, it cares little for armour, and a shield only softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
